.57.png\n\n## My request for Codex:\n页面中并没有看到动画\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"<image name=[Image #1]>"},{"type":"input_image","image_url":"data:image/png;base64,","detail":"high"},{"type":"input_text","text":"</image>"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"如何获得优质的LottieFiles动画库；目前几个动画不够优质\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"git搜索uiverse galaxy，哪些组件可以用在本app上\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"继续替换\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"macmini没有播放音乐\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"打开app\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"打开模拟器和app\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"在生成按钮下面增加一个半透明线条的进度生成条显示音乐生成进度\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"查询本地安装的pm skill\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"有 Product Manager \n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"调用/Users/vincet/.openclaw/workspace/skills/product-manager/SKILL.md 分析本app交互，有哪些需要改进部分\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"1Feed 动画要和音乐状态绑定\nLottie/Canvas 动画不只是装饰，应该播放时更活跃、暂停时静止或变慢、切歌时有过渡。这样用户能直观看到“音乐活着”，app写代码让动画与音乐节奏呼应；2底部 Tab 命名可以更产品化agent修改为Mood；3生成失败恢复\n失败后应该保留用户输入，并提供 Retry、Switch to instrumental、Random prompt 三个恢复动作。现在错误只是提示，行动不够明确。并且生成成功后给出弹出提示，用户点击跳转feed页面听音乐；4收藏之后缺少反馈\n点击收藏应有非常轻的状态反馈：按钮弹一下、短文本 Saved，并确保 Library 里立刻可见。\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"右侧增加一个切换播放模式的按钮：随机播放，单曲循环，顺序播放按个按钮切换\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"按钮中的图标没有居中，而且不好看，优化播放模式按钮Ui\n"}]},{"type":"message","role":"user","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"参考suno优秀的歌曲和提示词；再加入1000首歌曲提示词库\n"}]},{"type":"message","role