w Drive Ambient\",\n    \"mode\": \"Song\",\n    \"prompt\": \"ambient vocal electronica song about leaving the city after a long day, bittersweet but hopeful mood, smooth lead vocal with subtle choir-like backing layers, granular pads, minimal beat, floating vocal layers, spacious reverb, minimal verse into explosive chorus, emotional bridge, final hook, 140 BPM, D minor, polished streaming-ready mix, strong memorable chorus, emotionally direct lyrics, no artist names, no copyrighted references.\",\n    \"file\": \"seed_music/batch-song-15-afterglow-drive-ambient.mp3\",\n    \"bytes\": 2339078,\n    \"durationMs\": 72960,\n    \"generatedAt\": \"2026-04-28T01:13:27.143Z\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Afterglow Drive Country\",\n    \"mode\": \"Song\",\n    \"prompt\": \"country pop song about leaving the city after a long day, bittersweet but hopeful mood, clear expressive female lead vocal with soft layered harmonies, clean acoustic guitar, pedal steel colors, steady drums, heartfelt chorus, verse, pre-chorus, big chorus, short outro, 92 BPM, G major, polished streaming-ready mix, strong memorable chorus, emotionally direct lyrics, no artist names, no copyrighted references.\",\n    \"file\": \"seed_music/batch-song-16-afterglow-drive-country.mp3\",\n    \"bytes\": 2157502,\n    \"durationMs\": 67291,\n    \"generatedAt\": \"2026-04-28T01:16:39.905Z\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Afterglow Drive Punky\",\n    \"mode\": \"Song\",\n    \"prompt\": \"punky power pop song about leaving the city after a long day, bittersweet but hopeful mood, warm male lead vocal with intimate doubles in the chorus, fast guitars, punchy drums, shouty gang harmonies, catchy chorus, verse, chorus, post-chorus vocal tag, short ending, 116 BPM, D major, polished streaming-ready mix, strong memorable chorus, emotionally direct lyrics, no artist names, no copyrighted references.\",\n    \"file\": \"seed_music/batch-song-17-afterglow-drive-punky.mp3\",\n    \"bytes\": 1514875,\n    \"duration